1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,146
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:11,666
Target Zoe

3
00:00:12,166 --> 00:00:13,250
confirmed dead.

4
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:18,541
I asked Ching He's chairman, Thackery Huang, for a favor.

5
00:00:19,583 --> 00:00:21,208
This will save your life.

6
00:00:21,708 --> 00:00:22,708
CHING HE TEMPLE

7
00:00:22,791 --> 00:00:26,208
If you're ever in danger, use this to contact Ching He.

8
00:00:27,041 --> 00:00:29,458
There's key evidence that can control the Hsuehs.

9
00:01:10,708 --> 00:01:11,583
Hello?

10
00:01:12,166 --> 00:01:13,000
Hello?

11
00:01:16,166 --> 00:01:17,500
Gerald Chen said

12
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,583
if my life was in danger,

13
00:01:21,083 --> 00:01:22,541
I should make this call.

14
00:01:23,583 --> 00:01:24,708
Please.

15
00:01:25,208 --> 00:01:27,125
Save me and my daughter.

16
00:01:28,916 --> 00:01:29,958
I got it.

17
00:01:30,625 --> 00:01:32,500
I'll send someone right away.

18
00:01:48,875 --> 00:01:50,791
THE FIXERS

19
00:02:08,458 --> 00:02:11,833
FAKE, FORSAKEN, FRAUD

20
00:02:13,875 --> 00:02:17,166
Zoe is still alive. This isn't just bad for Yeh Yueh Tong.

21
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:19,583
It's also a threat

22
00:02:20,083 --> 00:02:21,291
to the Hsueh family.

23
00:02:21,375 --> 00:02:23,541
-I won't harm her. -I know you won't.

24
00:02:26,166 --> 00:02:27,833
At least not now.

25
00:02:28,666 --> 00:02:29,500
What do you mean?

26
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:33,166
Who knows if you will bring Zoe home

27
00:02:33,916 --> 00:02:35,166
to score points?

28
00:02:38,166 --> 00:02:40,416
You've been using me to find Zoe from the start.

29
00:02:41,041 --> 00:02:42,041
Right?

30
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:52,416
Since I was a child, I've never listened to my dad.

31
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:54,041
He can't stand the sight of me.

32
00:02:55,458 --> 00:02:56,625
You're right.

33
00:02:56,708 --> 00:02:58,625
If I bring Zoe home,

34
00:02:58,708 --> 00:03:00,458
he'll think highly of me.

35
00:03:00,958 --> 00:03:01,791
Right?

36
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:06,000
-What will you do? -What about you?

37
00:03:09,583 --> 00:03:11,750
Madam Fan sent someone to kill Gerald.

38
00:03:13,791 --> 00:03:15,458
I won't let this slide.

39
00:03:15,541 --> 00:03:18,333
You're declaring war on the entire Yeh Yueh Tong.

40
00:03:19,083 --> 00:03:21,041
Even if it's possible, imagine the fallout.

41
00:03:21,125 --> 00:03:22,750
What's there to consider?

42
00:03:23,750 --> 00:03:25,458
Gerald is already dead.

43
00:03:25,541 --> 00:03:27,458
You don't need to follow him to the grave.

44
00:03:28,708 --> 00:03:30,250
This is my own life.

45
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:36,041
-I don't need your advice. -Dying won't bring him back.

46
00:03:37,416 --> 00:03:40,208
-Is it worth it? -Have you ever wanted to protect anyone?

47
00:03:49,375 --> 00:03:51,916
BROTHER: DAD ISN'T WELL. COME TO THE HOSPITAL QUICKLY.

48
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,500
How's Dad doing now?

49
00:03:57,125 --> 00:03:58,583
Doctor said it's liver cancer.

50
00:03:59,083 --> 00:04:00,500
It has metastasized.

51
00:04:01,083 --> 00:04:03,125
This is bad, and you're only telling me now?

52
00:04:03,833 --> 00:04:06,708
He told me not to tell you, so you wouldn't worry.

53
00:04:07,541 --> 00:04:08,875
He isn't doing well today.

54
00:04:08,958 --> 00:04:10,916
Try not to talk back to him.

55
00:04:14,541 --> 00:04:16,250
Dad, are you okay?

56
00:04:18,083 --> 00:04:18,958
I'm okay.

57
00:04:19,958 --> 00:04:21,333
I just had chemotherapy.

58
00:04:21,916 --> 00:04:23,625
I don't feel very well.

59
00:04:25,541 --> 00:04:27,125
Don't tell the public

60
00:04:28,166 --> 00:04:29,875
about my illness.

61
00:04:30,875 --> 00:04:32,666
At a time like this,

62
00:04:32,750 --> 00:04:34,791
politics still matters more than your health?

63
00:04:35,291 --> 00:04:36,708
Why did you hide it from me?

64
00:04:38,375 --> 00:04:39,583
What about you?

65
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:42,666
When did you join Ching He?

66
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,458
Did it ever occur to you

67
00:04:47,416 --> 00:04:53,333
that Thackery asked you to join Ching He for a reason?

68
00:04:54,125 --> 00:04:55,833
By working for him,

69
00:04:56,333 --> 00:04:57,708
anytime, anywhere,

70
00:04:58,750 --> 00:05:01,583
you become a pawn that can threaten the Hsueh family.

71
00:05:01,666 --> 00:05:03,333
I know what I'm doing.

72
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:07,625
If anything does happen, I won't drag the Hsueh family into it.

73
00:05:09,791 --> 00:05:11,333
Do you think

74
00:05:12,083 --> 00:05:13,833
I only care about your brother?

75
00:05:15,125 --> 00:05:16,958
You are my son too.

76
00:05:25,958 --> 00:05:27,416
I keep wondering.

77
00:05:30,333 --> 00:05:33,000
Did I not show you how much I cared?

78
00:05:34,416 --> 00:05:38,541
Did I invest too much in your brother?

79
00:05:39,458 --> 00:05:43,291
Is that why you're doing this to prove yourself?

80
00:05:45,416 --> 00:05:47,750
I was too strict with you.

81
00:05:49,041 --> 00:05:50,833
Now that I think about it…

82
00:05:53,666 --> 00:05:56,375
I never gave you the chance to show me what you can do.

83
00:05:58,041 --> 00:05:59,416
You did this

84
00:06:00,583 --> 00:06:02,958
because you didn't want the world to learn who I am.

85
00:06:03,041 --> 00:06:05,125
It would embarrass the Hsueh family, right?

86
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:07,375
If that's what I cared about,

87
00:06:08,041 --> 00:06:10,375
why would I have kept you around?

88
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:16,750
I failed your mom.

89
00:06:18,708 --> 00:06:20,375
Before your mom passed away,

90
00:06:21,291 --> 00:06:22,666
I promised her

91
00:06:23,666 --> 00:06:27,791
I would raise you well.

92
00:06:30,416 --> 00:06:33,916
I only hope that you will think carefully

93
00:06:34,416 --> 00:06:36,125
before you do anything.

94
00:06:36,625 --> 00:06:40,041
Think about our family.

95
00:06:42,416 --> 00:06:43,916
I am getting old.

96
00:06:45,416 --> 00:06:47,208
I don't have much time left

97
00:06:48,125 --> 00:06:49,500
to be with you two.

98
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:53,000
From now on…

99
00:06:54,708 --> 00:06:58,708
you and your brother must look after each other.

100
00:06:59,208 --> 00:07:00,375
All right?

101
00:07:12,875 --> 00:07:14,000
Are you okay?

102
00:07:15,041 --> 00:07:15,916
You knew, right?

103
00:07:16,416 --> 00:07:18,708
That I joined Ching He as a fixer.

104
00:07:19,958 --> 00:07:21,291
How did you find out?

105
00:07:23,791 --> 00:07:26,166
Dad didn't say who told him.

106
00:07:27,333 --> 00:07:29,250
William is dead. Did you know that?

107
00:07:29,750 --> 00:07:32,750
I saw it on the news. Suicide by carbon monoxide poisoning.

108
00:07:33,250 --> 00:07:34,583
You didn't invest with him, right?

109
00:07:37,166 --> 00:07:41,125
He helped launder a ton of cash from the Hsin Nan project, didn't he?

110
00:07:46,333 --> 00:07:47,625
How did you know?

111
00:07:48,333 --> 00:07:50,375
I have my sources.

112
00:07:53,375 --> 00:07:56,541
That project is a huge cash cow.

113
00:07:57,041 --> 00:07:59,333
Everyone in the party took a piece.

114
00:07:59,833 --> 00:08:02,083
Dad's influence in the party was weakening.

115
00:08:02,166 --> 00:08:04,000
He couldn't offend those heavyweights.

116
00:08:04,083 --> 00:08:07,333
He had no choice but to play along.

117
00:08:08,625 --> 00:08:11,333
Why ask Yeh Yueh Tong to kill Zoe and her family?

118
00:08:12,666 --> 00:08:15,541
Zoe's husband, Hsu Ming-yi, knew about this.

119
00:08:16,041 --> 00:08:17,166
He demanded a hefty sum

120
00:08:17,750 --> 00:08:20,833
and wanted Dad's support to run for the legislature.

121
00:08:27,125 --> 00:08:29,416
Hsu Ming-yi even found out

122
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,666
that Dad had you with a student.

123
00:08:33,458 --> 00:08:34,875
He blackmailed him.

124
00:08:36,583 --> 00:08:38,000
Dad wanted to protect you

125
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:40,125
and the Hsueh family.

126
00:08:40,625 --> 00:08:42,041
He really was out of options.

127
00:08:43,041 --> 00:08:44,750
So he asked Yeh Yueh Tong for help.

128
00:08:53,125 --> 00:08:54,708
He's in poor health now.

129
00:08:55,291 --> 00:08:56,958
Don't bring these things up to him.

130
00:09:00,250 --> 00:09:02,791
I'm going to stay with him for a while. What about you?

131
00:09:04,166 --> 00:09:05,625
I'll stay a little longer.

132
00:09:25,791 --> 00:09:28,791
A new type of drug was found at the scene.

133
00:09:28,875 --> 00:09:32,583
It may cause the heart to stop temporarily.

134
00:09:32,666 --> 00:09:35,875
Users may even become unconscious and appear dead.

135
00:09:35,958 --> 00:09:37,541
Sir, do you have any left?

136
00:09:38,041 --> 00:09:40,083
Sorry, we're closed.

137
00:10:00,916 --> 00:10:02,333
Long time no see.

138
00:10:18,916 --> 00:10:20,708
SHEN: BEN IS IN TROUBLE

139
00:11:13,833 --> 00:11:15,708
GERALD CHEN, YEH YUEH TONG

140
00:11:15,791 --> 00:11:17,875
MISSING, KIDNAPPED, DRUGS

141
00:11:19,750 --> 00:11:21,166
In the beginning,

142
00:11:21,708 --> 00:11:23,833
you joined Yeh Yueh Tong

143
00:11:24,416 --> 00:11:26,000
in order to look for Gerald.

144
00:11:27,333 --> 00:11:28,708
At the time,

145
00:11:29,541 --> 00:11:30,916
I knew

146
00:11:31,416 --> 00:11:33,583
he had trained a good apprentice.

147
00:11:35,708 --> 00:11:37,041
Release him.

148
00:11:38,916 --> 00:11:40,458
Where is Zoe?

149
00:11:47,375 --> 00:11:49,166
You know what will happen

150
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:50,833
if I pull it out, don't you?

151
00:11:51,958 --> 00:11:53,833
You already sent someone to kill Gerald.

152
00:11:54,458 --> 00:11:56,125
So why'd you ask me to look for him?

153
00:11:57,041 --> 00:11:59,291
We never found his body.

154
00:11:59,791 --> 00:12:03,666
I was going to use you to see if he was alive.

155
00:12:04,166 --> 00:12:06,250
To my surprise, I discovered

156
00:12:06,750 --> 00:12:10,166
Zoe still lives.

157
00:12:10,750 --> 00:12:12,416
If you have the guts, kill me.

158
00:12:12,916 --> 00:12:14,458
Let him go.

159
00:12:14,541 --> 00:12:16,708
You are just as capable as Gerald.

160
00:12:16,791 --> 00:12:18,750
But one slight misstep,

161
00:12:20,625 --> 00:12:22,291
and you would turn on me.

162
00:12:24,291 --> 00:12:26,083
Where is Zoe?

163
00:12:26,791 --> 00:12:27,791
Don't… don't tell her.

164
00:12:29,291 --> 00:12:30,791
Even if you tell her,

165
00:12:31,291 --> 00:12:33,375
she won't let us go.

166
00:12:33,458 --> 00:12:35,166
You should know very well

167
00:12:35,750 --> 00:12:38,000
how long he can hold on.

168
00:12:41,625 --> 00:12:42,708
I don't know.

169
00:12:42,791 --> 00:12:43,791
I never expected

170
00:12:43,875 --> 00:12:47,708
Zoe's life to be more important to you than his.

171
00:12:51,583 --> 00:12:53,250
I really don't know.

172
00:12:53,875 --> 00:12:54,875
Please.

173
00:12:56,166 --> 00:12:57,291
Let him go.

174
00:13:03,583 --> 00:13:05,125
Let them go.

175
00:13:08,250 --> 00:13:09,583
Louis Hsueh.

176
00:13:10,583 --> 00:13:13,750
The Hsueh family's younger son. I've heard great things about you.

177
00:13:13,833 --> 00:13:15,375
Let the two of them go,

178
00:13:15,458 --> 00:13:17,541
and I will drop this matter.

179
00:13:18,791 --> 00:13:21,916
Is everyone at Ching He so cocky?

180
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:26,750
If news of Yeh Yueh Tong's incompetence reached my dad's ears,

181
00:13:27,250 --> 00:13:28,916
what would he think?

182
00:13:29,875 --> 00:13:33,125
Are you speaking to me on behalf of the Hsueh family

183
00:13:33,708 --> 00:13:36,708
or Ching He?

184
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,791
What do you think?

185
00:13:52,958 --> 00:13:54,250
You must remember.

186
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,416
I am the one standing by the Hsueh family.

187
00:13:58,333 --> 00:13:59,333
Mina,

188
00:13:59,833 --> 00:14:03,083
he met his fate because of your betrayal.

189
00:14:10,583 --> 00:14:11,416
Gerald…

190
00:14:12,375 --> 00:14:14,333
Is Gerald really dead?

191
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:20,208
This isn't your fault.

192
00:14:22,875 --> 00:14:25,458
You… you must move on.

193
00:14:26,458 --> 00:14:28,791
Live… well.

194
00:14:30,916 --> 00:14:32,541
When I see Gerald,

195
00:14:34,291 --> 00:14:37,791
I… I will tell him that.

196
00:14:40,916 --> 00:14:42,500
The stall downstairs…

197
00:14:45,208 --> 00:14:46,458
Okay.

198
00:14:47,083 --> 00:14:48,583
I know.

199
00:14:54,625 --> 00:14:56,708
Don't leave.

200
00:15:01,291 --> 00:15:03,291
Don't leave.

201
00:15:44,791 --> 00:15:46,875
Hello? Lix's Express.

202
00:15:46,958 --> 00:15:48,625
Can you pick up a package now?

203
00:15:48,708 --> 00:15:50,166
It's safe. Go ahead.

204
00:15:50,250 --> 00:15:51,666
Why did you go?

205
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:53,333
The chairman was looking for you.

206
00:15:55,291 --> 00:15:56,333
Ben is dead.

207
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,333
What?

208
00:15:59,958 --> 00:16:01,083
Ben is dead?

209
00:16:02,333 --> 00:16:05,000
We didn't find Gerald, but we found Zoe.

210
00:16:06,041 --> 00:16:08,458
I just rescued Mina from Madam Fan.

211
00:16:09,041 --> 00:16:10,500
But I was still too late.

212
00:16:11,416 --> 00:16:12,958
How did you two find Zoe?

213
00:16:13,833 --> 00:16:17,166
Gerald was sent by Yeh Yueh Tong to kill Zoe.

214
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:19,500
But he couldn't do it, so he faked her death.

215
00:16:20,083 --> 00:16:22,458
Now Madam Fan knows Zoe is alive.

216
00:16:22,541 --> 00:16:24,125
She'll get rid of her for good.

217
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:27,333
No wonder the chairman wanted me to protect Zoe.

218
00:16:27,416 --> 00:16:28,416
I'm heading to her.

219
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,833
How did he find out?

220
00:16:30,708 --> 00:16:32,291
He didn't say much.

221
00:16:32,875 --> 00:16:34,333
Let me bring her back first.

222
00:16:34,416 --> 00:16:36,166
Okay. Be careful.

223
00:16:36,250 --> 00:16:38,208
Yeh Yueh Tong won't just let this go.

224
00:16:38,291 --> 00:16:41,750
Don't worry. They'll have to get in line if they want to take my life.

225
00:16:48,333 --> 00:16:49,166
Felix?

226
00:16:52,458 --> 00:16:53,791
Zoe is fine.

227
00:16:53,875 --> 00:16:55,916
Felix is taking her back to Ching He Temple.

228
00:16:56,958 --> 00:16:59,416
How did Ching He know where Zoe was?

229
00:17:01,583 --> 00:17:03,125
Do you think I know?

230
00:17:04,791 --> 00:17:06,583
Get some rest first.

231
00:17:06,666 --> 00:17:08,416
Get on a plane tonight and leave.

232
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:10,083
Who says I'm leaving?

233
00:17:10,916 --> 00:17:12,750
Do you think Madam Fan will spare you?

234
00:17:12,833 --> 00:17:14,916
She killed the only family I had left.

235
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:17,000
I will make her pay.

236
00:17:17,083 --> 00:17:19,250
We don't even know why Ching He wants Zoe.

237
00:17:19,333 --> 00:17:22,375
Stepping into this fight only puts you in more danger.

238
00:17:25,458 --> 00:17:26,875
Are you worried about me

239
00:17:27,375 --> 00:17:29,083
or that I'll drag the Hsuehs down?

240
00:17:31,625 --> 00:17:32,875
Think what you want.

241
00:17:34,458 --> 00:17:35,583
It's your life.

242
00:17:36,083 --> 00:17:38,916
I don't want to have to collect your body later.

243
00:17:43,041 --> 00:17:45,166
I will take care of my own business.

244
00:17:45,916 --> 00:17:47,166
I won't trouble you.

245
00:18:00,708 --> 00:18:03,083
I thought you never leave a trace.

246
00:18:04,125 --> 00:18:06,833
Louis knows that we hired Yeh Yueh Tong.

247
00:18:07,458 --> 00:18:08,416
Don't worry.

248
00:18:08,916 --> 00:18:11,416
I will clean this up.

249
00:18:12,916 --> 00:18:14,875
I won't leave any loose ends.

250
00:18:15,541 --> 00:18:17,541
Regarding Thackery, I've arranged everything.

251
00:18:18,125 --> 00:18:20,458
I hope you won't make any more mistakes.

252
00:18:35,708 --> 00:18:36,958
What's wrong?

253
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:46,000
It's the groundbreaking ceremony.

254
00:18:46,583 --> 00:18:48,375
I've arranged everything. Don't worry.

255
00:18:53,666 --> 00:18:55,166
I…

256
00:18:57,041 --> 00:18:58,583
probably won't make it

257
00:18:59,083 --> 00:19:01,416
to the day you become mayor.

258
00:19:01,500 --> 00:19:02,416
Dad,

259
00:19:02,916 --> 00:19:05,333
I've arranged for the best doctor.

260
00:19:06,291 --> 00:19:08,333
If they can't treat you here, we'll go abroad.

261
00:19:08,833 --> 00:19:10,416
You will get better.

262
00:19:10,916 --> 00:19:13,375
I will make sure

263
00:19:13,458 --> 00:19:15,791
you watch me reach the top,

264
00:19:16,291 --> 00:19:17,916
not just become mayor.

265
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:27,333
I never have to worry about you.

266
00:19:29,250 --> 00:19:33,291
It is always your brother.

267
00:19:34,375 --> 00:19:37,291
As long as he stays with Ching He,

268
00:19:37,875 --> 00:19:39,541
I cannot rest easy.

269
00:19:40,041 --> 00:19:41,125
Don't worry.

270
00:19:41,208 --> 00:19:43,500
After all, he is still a part of the Hsueh family.

271
00:19:43,583 --> 00:19:46,208
Has he ever seen himself that way?

272
00:19:47,208 --> 00:19:50,333
He joined Ching He behind my back.

273
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,750
If you hadn't stopped me,

274
00:19:54,583 --> 00:19:57,375
I would have…

275
00:19:58,291 --> 00:19:59,125
Dad.

276
00:19:59,625 --> 00:20:01,375
Don't think about it, Dad.

277
00:20:01,875 --> 00:20:03,375
Your health matters most now.

278
00:20:04,375 --> 00:20:05,833
Knowing Louis,

279
00:20:05,916 --> 00:20:07,500
forcing him to quit now

280
00:20:07,583 --> 00:20:09,250
will only push him further away.

281
00:20:10,291 --> 00:20:13,333
I'm thinking, let him stay with Ching He.

282
00:20:13,833 --> 00:20:15,791
Maybe that could help us in the future.

283
00:20:20,916 --> 00:20:25,916
All those years of effort weren't wasted on you.

284
00:20:26,958 --> 00:20:29,708
I have to thank you for cooperating with me.

285
00:20:31,958 --> 00:20:33,250
Get some rest.

286
00:20:34,791 --> 00:20:36,458
Just leave the rest to me.

287
00:20:44,875 --> 00:20:46,708
You… you won't…

288
00:20:48,250 --> 00:20:50,083
harm your brother, will you?

289
00:20:54,041 --> 00:20:55,708
He is my own brother.

290
00:20:56,625 --> 00:20:58,416
How could I possibly harm him?

291
00:21:21,458 --> 00:21:24,208
You haven't offered incense at Ching He Temple in so long.

292
00:21:25,875 --> 00:21:27,750
Last time I set foot in the main hall,

293
00:21:28,500 --> 00:21:30,500
my dad was still alive.

294
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,791
This time around,

295
00:21:33,375 --> 00:21:35,166
I cannot come unprepared.

296
00:21:36,291 --> 00:21:39,208
What are you praying for this time?

297
00:21:44,583 --> 00:21:47,291
I pray that God will bring me justice.

298
00:21:50,041 --> 00:21:51,708
Everything I did

299
00:21:52,208 --> 00:21:54,208
was to protect Ching He.

300
00:21:54,291 --> 00:21:56,000
Wasn't that also true

301
00:21:56,916 --> 00:21:58,625
of my dad and me?

302
00:22:01,583 --> 00:22:02,833
Fixer Lunar,

303
00:22:02,916 --> 00:22:07,958
anything that disrupts the balance of the world,

304
00:22:08,583 --> 00:22:11,666
no matter how well-intentioned, is wrong.

305
00:22:14,833 --> 00:22:16,125
All I know is,

306
00:22:17,666 --> 00:22:19,291
I won't let anyone

307
00:22:20,041 --> 00:22:22,583
take away what's mine again.

308
00:22:27,791 --> 00:22:29,333
Should I see you out?

309
00:22:29,416 --> 00:22:31,416
I should be the one doing that.

310
00:22:32,250 --> 00:22:33,916
I came to say goodbye to you.

311
00:22:38,875 --> 00:22:40,916
Sir, the mayor reportedly holds

312
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:43,791
some of the bribe money that Mr. Chao Ming-cheng accepted.

313
00:22:43,875 --> 00:22:45,708
What do you say to this?

314
00:22:46,416 --> 00:22:47,833
I can't comment on that.

315
00:22:47,916 --> 00:22:49,291
It is under investigation.

316
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:53,416
But I believe that for a politician,

317
00:22:53,500 --> 00:22:55,625
integrity is the most important thing.

318
00:22:56,125 --> 00:22:58,541
Will the party take any action against Mr. Chao?

319
00:22:58,625 --> 00:23:01,666
Should the mayor apologize to the public?

320
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:03,958
What action will the party take?

321
00:23:04,041 --> 00:23:04,875
Sir, could you…

322
00:23:04,958 --> 00:23:06,083
Mr. Huang,

323
00:23:06,166 --> 00:23:09,000
we're working on the bribery case against Mr. Chao Ming-cheng.

324
00:23:09,875 --> 00:23:11,875
We believe you are involved.

325
00:23:11,958 --> 00:23:13,541
You need to come with us.

326
00:23:14,458 --> 00:23:15,791
This is a search warrant.

327
00:23:15,875 --> 00:23:17,875
We will now search Ching He Temple.

328
00:23:18,875 --> 00:23:20,291
-Go in and search. -Yes, sir.

329
00:23:40,541 --> 00:23:44,291
There were new developments in the bribery case against Chao.

330
00:23:44,375 --> 00:23:47,041
Investigators launched a second wave of searches today

331
00:23:47,125 --> 00:23:50,833
targeting Thackery Huang, who chairs Ching He, an influential local group.

332
00:23:50,916 --> 00:23:54,041
Thackery Huang was suspected of being an intermediary in the bribery.

333
00:23:54,125 --> 00:23:57,083
He was escorted to the police station earlier…

334
00:24:00,166 --> 00:24:01,750
I want to talk to you in private.

335
00:24:04,666 --> 00:24:07,125
Did you get Thackery arrested?

336
00:24:11,541 --> 00:24:12,375
Yes.

337
00:24:13,208 --> 00:24:15,083
Are you helping Madam Fan seize Ching He?

338
00:24:15,583 --> 00:24:17,750
Ching He belonged to Madam Fan.

339
00:24:17,833 --> 00:24:19,166
How is it seizing?

340
00:24:19,916 --> 00:24:21,500
You're supporting Madam Fan.

341
00:24:21,583 --> 00:24:24,500
It can't just be to cover up what Dad did, right?

342
00:24:28,791 --> 00:24:31,083
I often say you're far smarter than I am.

343
00:24:31,625 --> 00:24:32,958
Dad just doesn't believe it.

344
00:24:35,583 --> 00:24:37,000
What is your goal?

345
00:24:37,791 --> 00:24:39,625
I want Ching He's Primordial Files.

346
00:24:43,916 --> 00:24:45,166
You want the secret files?

347
00:24:45,666 --> 00:24:46,500
That's right.

348
00:24:47,791 --> 00:24:51,083
The former Fixer Celestial, Madam Fan's dad,

349
00:24:51,583 --> 00:24:53,041
hid the Primordial Files

350
00:24:53,125 --> 00:24:55,000
in a secret room in Kuang Ming Chamber.

351
00:24:55,500 --> 00:24:58,375
Only Madam Fan knows how to unlock the room.

352
00:24:58,875 --> 00:25:00,625
Not even Thackery.

353
00:25:02,208 --> 00:25:05,000
So you want to get the Primordial Files from Madam Fan.

354
00:25:06,708 --> 00:25:08,750
Madam Fan knows what Dad has done.

355
00:25:09,250 --> 00:25:11,041
If she reclaims Ching He,

356
00:25:11,125 --> 00:25:13,583
she will have the Hsueh family by the throat.

357
00:25:13,666 --> 00:25:15,333
She could turn on us anytime.

358
00:25:15,833 --> 00:25:18,541
So we must get to the Primordial Files before her.

359
00:25:19,041 --> 00:25:21,166
That way, we can control both sides of the law.

360
00:25:22,333 --> 00:25:24,916
Neither Ching He nor Yeh Yueh Tong

361
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:27,000
can threaten the Hsueh family.

362
00:25:29,875 --> 00:25:31,458
Is that necessary?

363
00:25:31,541 --> 00:25:32,958
You don't have to help me.

364
00:25:36,541 --> 00:25:38,458
But if you don't, those you care about,

365
00:25:39,083 --> 00:25:41,500
those you want to protect, could be in danger.

366
00:25:53,083 --> 00:25:55,208
First, eliminate Thackery.

367
00:25:55,708 --> 00:25:57,166
Then, Madam Fan.

368
00:25:57,791 --> 00:25:59,083
As for Ching He,

369
00:26:00,375 --> 00:26:02,291
I hope you will be in charge of it.

370
00:26:04,000 --> 00:26:05,916
Me, in charge of Ching He?

371
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:10,166
Only by holding real power at the top

372
00:26:10,250 --> 00:26:13,250
can you protect those you care about.

373
00:26:19,416 --> 00:26:20,958
When I become mayor,

374
00:26:21,666 --> 00:26:23,416
and you control Ching He,

375
00:26:24,291 --> 00:26:25,791
you will be in the dark,

376
00:26:26,375 --> 00:26:27,541
and I in the light.

377
00:26:28,333 --> 00:26:30,291
If we unite as brothers,

378
00:26:31,791 --> 00:26:33,375
who could threaten us?

379
00:26:49,541 --> 00:26:50,583
Howie,

380
00:26:51,083 --> 00:26:54,166
does your dad really have Parkinson's?

381
00:26:55,208 --> 00:26:56,583
He told me himself.

382
00:26:56,666 --> 00:26:58,625
He told me not to tell you.

383
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:02,166
You know he likes to talk nonsense all the time.

384
00:27:02,250 --> 00:27:03,875
I saw his bag of pills.

385
00:27:10,583 --> 00:27:12,750
Howie, listen to me.

386
00:27:12,833 --> 00:27:15,000
From now on, I will take good care of your dad.

387
00:27:15,083 --> 00:27:16,583
You just focus on your studies.

388
00:27:16,666 --> 00:27:18,041
What are you talking about?

389
00:27:18,125 --> 00:27:19,791
I can take care of him too, okay?

390
00:27:20,291 --> 00:27:22,000
It's all on your dad's stubbornness.

391
00:27:22,083 --> 00:27:24,791
He could've just been honest about the necklace.

392
00:27:24,875 --> 00:27:26,791
His behavior made me think he was cheating.

393
00:27:26,875 --> 00:27:27,708
Hey.

394
00:27:27,791 --> 00:27:30,375
Tell him you found it out on your own.

395
00:27:30,458 --> 00:27:31,583
Don't say I told you.

396
00:27:31,666 --> 00:27:32,875
I know.

397
00:27:37,208 --> 00:27:39,000
Like two silly boys.

398
00:27:40,041 --> 00:27:41,083
Ridiculous.

399
00:27:44,291 --> 00:27:46,083
Darn it, Felix.

400
00:27:46,166 --> 00:27:47,833
Forgot to bring his keys again.

401
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:10,041
What is it?

402
00:28:11,583 --> 00:28:13,375
That car must have broken down.

403
00:28:14,791 --> 00:28:16,166
The road ahead is blocked.

404
00:28:16,666 --> 00:28:17,666
Wait in the car.

405
00:28:18,666 --> 00:28:21,583
Is Felix Chiang here?

406
00:28:22,333 --> 00:28:23,250
What is this for?

407
00:28:30,916 --> 00:28:33,000
I am his business acquaintance.

408
00:28:35,916 --> 00:28:38,125
A business acquaintance?

409
00:28:39,083 --> 00:28:44,166
I… haven't heard him mention anything about doing business.

410
00:28:46,458 --> 00:28:47,416
Is he not here?

411
00:28:47,500 --> 00:28:48,333
No, he's not.

412
00:28:49,500 --> 00:28:50,416
How about this?

413
00:28:50,500 --> 00:28:52,125
Give me your number.

414
00:28:52,208 --> 00:28:53,791
I'll ask him to call you.

415
00:29:17,375 --> 00:29:19,625
Is your son not here either?

416
00:29:19,708 --> 00:29:20,833
He's not here either.

417
00:29:22,000 --> 00:29:24,416
He's out studying with his classmates.

418
00:29:38,583 --> 00:29:42,250
You've lived in this house for over 20 years, right?

419
00:29:44,291 --> 00:29:46,208
Since we got married.

420
00:29:46,958 --> 00:29:48,458
We've never moved.

421
00:29:49,208 --> 00:29:50,333
How sentimental.

422
00:29:51,583 --> 00:29:54,666
You two must be close.

423
00:29:58,458 --> 00:30:00,125
But that's hard to say.

424
00:30:00,625 --> 00:30:05,666
It seems like he's hiding a lot from you.

425
00:30:08,208 --> 00:30:12,166
I told Felix I call the shots in this house.

426
00:30:12,250 --> 00:30:16,333
Whatever mess he's made outside, I don't care, nor do I want to know.

427
00:30:16,416 --> 00:30:18,958
If there's nothing else, please leave.

428
00:30:19,041 --> 00:30:20,916
I have something important

429
00:30:21,416 --> 00:30:23,291
to ask Felix.

430
00:31:44,750 --> 00:31:46,208
Dad, hurry back.

431
00:31:46,708 --> 00:31:47,916
There's trouble.

432
00:31:49,458 --> 00:31:52,500
HOWIE, TAKE CARE OF YOUR MOM. TELL HER I'LL BE BACK SOON!

433
00:32:29,916 --> 00:32:31,708
I'm gonna take a look. You be careful.

434
00:32:31,791 --> 00:32:32,625
Okay.

435
00:32:36,125 --> 00:32:38,416
Sorry. I've called roadside assistance.

436
00:32:38,916 --> 00:32:41,500
My son has a high fever. I need to get to the hospital.

437
00:32:41,583 --> 00:32:44,166
It won't take much longer. I called over two hours ago.

438
00:33:10,125 --> 00:33:10,958
We'll go to the ER.

439
00:33:14,416 --> 00:33:15,583
Please.

440
00:33:16,083 --> 00:33:18,083
You must protect my daughter.

441
00:33:25,166 --> 00:33:26,333
CHING HE TEMPLE

442
00:33:26,416 --> 00:33:27,750
Give this…

443
00:33:30,000 --> 00:33:31,541
to Thackery Huang.

444
00:33:33,250 --> 00:33:34,416
The video

445
00:33:35,708 --> 00:33:37,166
has to do with…

446
00:33:41,375 --> 00:33:42,708
CHING HE TEMPLE

447
00:33:42,791 --> 00:33:44,416
…the Hsueh family.

448
00:37:29,541 --> 00:37:32,333
Subtitle translation by: Hannah Liu
